    [Doc][Misc] Update deployment documentation and model tutorials (#19854)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates and refines the deployment documentation and model
    tutorials for vLLM Ascend. Specifically, it:
    - Standardizes the naming of \"vLLM Ascend\" across documents.\n- Fixes
    relative links and section anchors in various model tutorials (e.g.,
    Qwen and DeepSeek).
    - Updates code block syntax highlighting (e.g., changing `text`/`shell`
    to `output` for command outputs).
    - Cleans up formatting, removes duplicate paragraphs, and corrects minor
    typos.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this PR only updates documentation and tutorials.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation changes only; verified markdown rendering and link
    consistency.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
    Signed-off-by: sunshine202600 <sunshine202600@163.com>

